<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20444] Add restore timestamp in hsm_attrs</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20444</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It is beneficial to track when a file was restored successfully to make policy decisions to improve storage utilization.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Proposed change is to add `hsm_restore_timestamp` field to hsm_attrs. This will be set by mdt_coordinator after successful hsm_restore and clean up after hsm_remove.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
